		'make <module_name>_tb' to build module + testbench
		'make <module_name>.sim' to sim tb on cmd line
		'make <module_name>.wav' to sim tb with gui
		'make <module_name>.syn' to synthesize functional net list
		'make <module_name>.synt' to synthesize timing net list
	Lint Rules:
		'make <module_name>.lint' to run the linter on module
		'make <module_name>_tb.lint' to run the linter on module testbench
	Clean Rules:
		'make clean' to clean everything
		'make clean_sim' to clean simulation logs and work lib
		'make clean_asm' to clean hex and testasm output
		'make clean_map' to clean mapped dir
		'make clean_fpga' to clean fpga dir
	Obviously a testbench file must exist for some options.

